The reviewer policy in src/policy.ts is adapted from the OpenAI Codex Guardian
auto-review policy and policy template:

  https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/c82cb044f3413e6584308d969b94e7a1430711ab/codex-rs/core/src/guardian

Its user-authorization ladder, risk taxonomy, tenant policy structure, and
several definitions are paraphrased or derived from that source. The plugin
adds OpenCode permission semantics, human escalation, confidence validation,
isolated review, and SSH, local-script, and Git evidence enrichment.

